Architecture: all
Conflicts: pve-sharedlvmthin-thick
Replaces: pve-sharedlvmthin-thick
Provides: pve-sharedlvmthin-storage-plugin
Pre-Depends: python3, lvm2, multipath-tools, pve-manager, libpve-storage-perl
Depends: lvm2, perl, python3, openssl, multipath-tools, util-linux,
 pve-manager, libpve-storage-perl
Maintainer: SharedLvmThin Community <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Shared LVM Thin and Thick Generations storage for Proxmox VE
 Experimental disposable-lab shared block backend offering either one LVM thin pool per VM or
 fully allocated Thick Generations with a linear steady-state frontend.
 Includes Proxmox cluster locking and guarded thin-pool autogrow.
 Includes read-only HTTPS health dashboard with native Proxmox VE
 authentication and storage path monitoring.
